---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="About" description={site.description}>
  <section class="about-wrap" id="top">
    <div class="wl-title">
      <h1>{site.name}</h1>
      <span class="wl-service">Art direction</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        Art Director based in Paris. I spent two years at Louis Vuitton Malletier, working on brand content
        and visual communication, before founding WLD Artwork, my creative studio, in 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work sits between luxury and lifestyle: visual identity, packaging, editorial and campaign
        imagery. I like giving shape to what has none yet, a scent, a memory, a brand intention, and building
        visual worlds where object, packaging and image tell the same story. Generative AI is part of my
        toolkit, and I direct it the way I would direct a shoot: a frame, a light, an intention.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond design, my background is entrepreneurial. It shaped the way I work: project management, team
        leadership, creative consulting and a pragmatic eye for what an image has to do once it leaves the
        screen, on a shelf, in a hand, on a phone.
      </p>
      <p>
        I create distinctive identities at the intersection of luxury, object and image. Available as an Art
        Director or right hand to an Art Director, in a studio or an agency.
      </p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li><span class="muted">Expertise:</span><span>Art direction, visual identity, packaging, editorial, campaigns, creative consulting</span></li>
        <li><span class="muted">Tools:</span><span>Photoshop, InDesign, Premiere Pro, generative AI</span></li>
        <li><span class="muted">Mail:</span><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
        <li>
          <span class="muted">Instagram:</span>
          <a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">@wldartwork</a>
        </li>
        <li><span class="muted">Based in:</span><span>{site.location}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
